list.description:
1. Assist HR Ops team to provide daily operation support, such as onboarding and resignation processing;
2. Assist HR Ops team in project work and promote implementation;
3. Handle HR operation related work.

list.requirement:
1. Undergraduate or master’s degree students, regardless of major, with priority given to human resources majors;
2. Strong logic, communication skills, writing skills, and learning ability;
3. English can be used as a working language;
4. Candidates who can work as an intern for 3 consecutive months or more and work 5 days a week will be preferred.
